   | officecli add ...
   | officecli set ...
   | officecli get ...
   | officecli validate ...
   | officecli view ...
   v
OfficeCLI
   |
   +---- DOCX
   +---- XLSX
   +---- PPTX

Song song, để preview:

Frontend
   |
   | POST /api/{word|excel|ppt}-preview/start
   v
AionCore office_routes
   |
   v
OfficecliWatchManager.start_for_user(...)
   |
   v
DefaultProcessSpawner.spawn_officecli(...)
