# 18. Enterprise-safe CommandRunner

Không nên để LLM có raw shell unrestricted.

Nên whitelist:

```rust
const ALLOWED_OFFICECLI_COMMANDS: &[&str] = &[
    "create",
    "open",
    "close",
    "get",
    "query",
    "view",
    "validate",
    "add",
    "set",
    "remove",
    "move",
    "copy",
];
```

Command spec:

```rust
pub struct OfficeCliCommand {
    pub verb: OfficeVerb,
    pub file: PathBuf,
    pub args: Vec<String>,
}
```

Execution:

```rust
pub async fn execute_officecli(
    workspace: &Path,
    cmd: OfficeCliCommand,
) -> Result<Output> {
    let canonical_workspace =
        workspace.canonicalize()?;

    let canonical_file =
        cmd.file.canonicalize()?;

    if !canonical_file
        .starts_with(
            &canonical_workspace
        )
    {
        anyhow::bail!(
            "file outside workspace"
        );
    }

    let officecli =
        resolve_command_path(
            "officecli"
        )
        .ok_or_else(
            || anyhow::anyhow!(
                "officecli not installed"
            )
        )?;

    let output =
        tokio::process::Command::new(
            officecli
        )
        .arg(cmd.verb.as_str())
        .arg(canonical_file)
        .args(cmd.args)
        .current_dir(
            canonical_workspace
        )
        .stdin(
            std::process::Stdio::null()
        )
        .output()
        .await?;

    Ok(output)
}
```

Enterprise nên thêm:

```text
- workspace isolation per job / tenant
- CPU / RAM / timeout limits
- no unrestricted bash
- command whitelist
- path canonicalization
- audit log
- prompt + tool call log
- document retention policy
- antivirus scan
- DLP scan
- file size limit
- OfficeCLI version pinning
- LLM provider policy
```

